<title>JAPAN: NCB&quot;s up on LDP official&quot;s remarks.</title>
<headline>NCB&quot;s up on LDP official&quot;s remarks.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Credit Bank Ltd climbed having been quoted bid-only in early morning trade on Thursday, after a government official was quoted as saying on Wednesday that public money could be used to protect creditors holding bank debentures, brokers said.</p>
<p>Bank debentures are mainly issued by long-term credit banks like NCB.</p>
<p>The share price of the long-term credit bank was up 16 yen at 220 yen at 0127 GMT, making it the largest percentage gainer on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
